onfidence in DK.C victory. High volume ($56k) suggests informed betting; market price of 70% is near analyst estimate of 72%, indicating consensus view. CONFIDENCE ASYMMETRY: Confidence_yes is 75 because briefing provides direct historical head-to-head favoring DK.C and consistent recent wins. Confidence_no is 62 because BRO.C's demonstrated upsets (Gen.G 3-0 win) and lack of detailed recent form against current DK.C roster composition creates uncertainty in the counterfactual. Data supporting BRO.C competitive path is limited. RESOLUTION MECHANISM: gol.gg is official source; standard esports match resolution risk is low given match is imminent (TODAY, ~9 hours out). No indication of forfeiture, disqualification, or cancellation. Winner will be determined by match outcome, not oracle delay. FINAL ASSESSMENT: DK.C is favored based on demonstrated 2-0 head-to-head superiority and recent dominant wins. BRO.C has shown it can win but lacks evidence of capability against DK.C specifically. Probability of 72 reflects strong but not overwhelming confidence in DK.C victory, with residual uncertainty from limited recent comparative data and potential for upset in single BO3.", "key_factor": "The briefing contains historical match data from January-February 2026, but the market references a Week 2 match on April 9, 2026; temporal inconsistency and unclear whether the cited 2-0 DK.C victory occurred in the same round-robin cycle creates ambiguity about recency and relevance of comparative strength."}, {"agent_name": "The Bull", "probability": 0.72, "confidence_yes": 0.78, "confidence_no": 0.62, "rationale": "DK.C's head-to-head record vs BRO.C in Rounds 1-2 is documented as 2-0, establishing a direct precedent for this matchup within the same competition phase. DK.C has shown consistent 2-0 victories against multiple opponents (DRX Challengers in Week 2), indicating reliable execution in BO3 format, while BRO.C has multiple 0-2 losses. BRO.C's 35.3% win rate across 17 games is