rrent playoff-specific stats available; most data from 2025 Challengers and Split 1 regular season", "Both teams have competed in Korean Valorant ecosystem with recent activity in early 2026", "No recent head-to-head playoff results or current form trajectory data provided in search results"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-09T11:16:20.054789Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-09T16:30:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-09T17:03:32.074794+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": {"kind": "missed_opportunity", "summary": "Missed opportunity \u2014 council favored YES at 69% (6/7 agents, 3 high-conv) but PASSed. Reason: YES-side confidence too low: 66% (need \u226567%)", "agents_with_winner": [{"agent": "The Rules Lawyer", "prob": 0.75, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.72, "key_factor": "Briefing contains outdated/incomplete 2025 performance data with no current 2026 playoff-specific form, roster changes, or recent head-to-head results; resolution mechanism is clear but underlying competitive assessment relies on stale information."}, {"agent": "The Bull", "prob": 0.76, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.72, "key_factor": "T1 Academy's access to T1's elite organizational resources and coaching infrastructure, combined with demonstrated individual player consistency (TenTen 1.39-1.60 ACS, strong KAST), provides a structural advantage in high-stakes playoff BO3 elimination format."}, {"agent": "The Sentiment Analyst", "prob": 0.74, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.72, "key_factor": "Rational"}, {"agent": "The Domain Specialist", "prob": 0.72, "side": "YES", "side_conf": 0.68, "key_factor": "T1 Academy's organizational infrastructure and demonstrated individual player consistency (TenTen's sustained 1.39-1.60 ACS) provide a measurable edge in high-stakes BO3 elimination formats, but the absence of recent playoff-specific data and Dplus's competitive 2025 metrics create meaningful uncertainty in a 5-hour window."}, {"agent": "The Cont