team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-10T03:45:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-09T21:45:00Z", "yes_price": 0.375, "volume_usd": 22218.656251999986, "category": "counter-strike"}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.38, "confidence_yes": 0.52, "confidence_no": 0.48, "rationale": "RESOLUTION CONDITION: Market resolves YES if Akimbo Esports wins the BO3 match; NO if InControl wins. Clear binary condition with forfeiture/tie carve-outs. CRITICAL DATA QUALITY ISSUE: The briefing contains corrupted text ('regainregainregain', 'FarmVilleFarmVille', duplicate entries, incomplete statistics). This undermines confidence in any strength assessment for both teams. AKIMBO RECENT FORM (reconstructed from corrupted data): Loss to FarmVille 0-2 in CCT Series 4 (same tournament, 06/04); wins vs BOSS 2-1 and FarmVille 2-1 in Dust2.us Eagle Masters; loss 1-2 to regain in Eagle Masters 7 (07/04). Mixed-to-negative trajectory in relevant tournament. INCONTROL RECENT FORM (reconstructed from corrupted data): Wins vs Beneath Reality 2-0 (28/03), Zomblers 2-0 (12/03), Fisher College 2-1 (08/03); losses to Zomblers 0-2 (21/02), Marsborne 0-2 (18/02); 1-2 loss to Outfit 49 (16/02). Stronger recent trajectory but inconsistent. TOURNAMENT CONTEXT: Both teams in CCT North America Series #4 Group A Elimination stage \u2014 same competitive tier, similar skill level expected at tier-2/3 NA scene. NO HEAD-TO-HEAD DATA: No direct match history provided; cannot assess historical matchups or specific tactical advantages. MARKET PRICING SIGNAL: Current market 38% YES / 62% NO suggests strong InControl favorability. This aligns with InControl's recent win streak vs Akimbo's mixed form and CCT tournament vulnerability. CASE FOR INCONTROL HIGHER P