 team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-10T21:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-10T15:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.235, "volume_usd": 9257.206480999997, "category": "league-of-legends"}, "key_facts": ["#### Support Games of Legends on Patreon and enjoy an ad-free experience:   Become a Patron\n\nBecome a Patron\n\n# BIG vs EWI\n\n# 30:55\n\nKills 10\nFirst Blood\nTowers\nDragons\nNashor\nTeam Gold\nJarvan IV\nAatrox\nOrianna\nBraum\nRakan\nFirst Pick\nRumble\nVi\nYone\nTaric\nCaitlyn\nKills\nTowers\nFirst Tower\nDragons\nOcean Drake\nMountain Drake\nHextech Drake\nHextech Drake\nNashor\nTeam Gold\nVarus\nAmbessa\nViego\nEzreal\nNautilus\nAzir\nYunara\nWukong\nAlistar\nCassiopeia [...] Runes\n\n###### Boots Arrival Time: 9:45\n\nRunes\n\n###### Time Completed: 13:0\n\nRunes\nRunes\nRunes\nRunes\n\n###### Total Bonus Damage: 744\n\nSummoner spell\nSummoner spell\nItem_3364 \nItem_6610 \nItem_3078 \nItem_3047 \nItem_3026 \nItem_1033 \nItem_1209 \nAzir\nRunes\nRunes\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Runes Precision | Runes Sorcery |\n| Runes Lethal Tempo Max Attack Speed Uptime: 310:310 | Runes Manaflow Band Total bonus mana: 250, Total mana restored: 599 |\n| Runes Presence of Mind Resource Restored: 2789 | Runes Scorch Total Bonus Damage: 835 |\n| Runes Legend: Alacrity Time Completed: 17:10 | Runes +10% Attack Speed  Runes +9 Adaptive Force  Runes Health |\n| Runes Cut Down Total Bonus Damage: 1141 |\n\nRunes\nRunes\nRunes\n\n###### Max Attack Speed Uptime: 310:310\n\nRunes [...] Runes\n\n###### Time Completed: 19:40\n\nRunes\nRunes\nRunes\nRunes\n\n###### Total Bonus Damage: 741\n\nSummoner spell\nSummoner spell\nItem_3363 \nItem_3172 \nItem_3031 \nItem_3153 \nItem_1054 \nItem_6673 \nItem_2055 \nItem_1206 \nCaitlyn\nRunes\nRunes\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Run