dible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-11T00:15:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-10T18:15:00Z", "yes_price": 0.325, "volume_usd": 1788.619252, "category": "counter-strike"}, "key_facts": ["--Field Level Media\n\nLatest\n\n### Alice Pereira Delivers Knockout of the Year Contender at UFC Vegas 115\n\nSun Apr 05 2026\n\n### Five Early 2026 MLB Takes That Might Already Be True\n\nSat Apr 04 2026\n\n### How Los Angeles Lakers Might Need Bronny James in NBA Playoffs\n\nSun Apr 05 2026\n\n### How European Complaints Miss the Point Ahead of 2026 World Cup\n\nSat Apr 04 2026\n\n### UFC Vegas 115 Betting Picks: Moicano vs.", "Duncan Headlines April 4th Card\n\nSat Apr 04 2026\n\n### NBA Betting Picks April 4th: Three Best Bets for Saturday's Slate\n\nSat Apr 04 2026\n\n### Michigan vs.", "Arizona Bets: Wolverines Hold Edge in Final Four Showdown\n\nFri Apr 03 2026\n\n### Illinois vs.", "History: Illini Fans Brace for Another March Madness Heartbreak\n\nFri Apr 03 2026 [...] Prediction Markets\n\n+ Prediction Markets\n+ Sports Prediction Market Sites\n+ Politics Prediction Markets\n+ Prediction Market Apps\n+ Are Prediction Markets Legal?", "+ How Prediction Markets Work\n+ K