 - LCKLCK LCK ranked 3rd in First Stand Tournament FST.", "- The winner of LCK Road to MSI's Upper Final will be the LCK's 1st seed in Mid-Season InvitationalMid-Season Invitational MSI.", "| [...] Mid-Season Invitational\nLCK\nLCK\nGen.G Esports\nGen.G Esports\nFEARX\nFEARX\nDplus\nDplus\nT1\nT1\nSOOPers\nSOOPers\nDRX\nDRX\nNongshim RedForce\nNongshim RedForce\nKT Rolster\nKT Rolster\nBRION\nBRION\nHanwha Life Esports\nHanwha Life Esports\nLCK\nLCK\nFirst Stand Tournament\nMid-Season Invitational\nMid-Season Invitational\nLCS\nLYON\nLYON\nCloud9\nCloud9\nSentinels\nSentinels\nTeam Liquid\nTeam Liquid\nFlyQuest\nFlyQuest\nDisguised\nDisguised\nDignitas\nDignitas\nShopify Rebellion\nShopify Rebellion\nLCS\nFirst Stand Tournament\nMid-Season Invitational\nMid-Season Invitational\nLoL Championship Pacific\nSecret Whales\nSecret Whales\nDeep Cross Gaming\nDeep Cross Gaming\nSoftBank HAWKS gaming\nSoftBank HAWKS gaming\nGround Zero Gaming\nGround Zero Gaming\nCTBC Flying Oyster\nCTBC Flying Oyster\nGAM Esports\nGAM Esports\nMVK Esports\nMVK Esports", "With 3 of the 5 Worlds 2022 winners, KT Rolster was the only team to take a match win against Gen.G in the Spring season, though they ended 5th after losing 2-3"], "news_summary": "The search results contain limited direct information about a Dplus KIA vs Gen.G matchup in LCK Rounds 1-2. Available data shows a Dplus KIA vs HLE game 2 timeline and player builds from Week 2, while Gen.G appears in Rounds 1-2 standings with a 2-1 record (5-2 games). The LCK 2026 season uses a double round-robin format with records carried over from Rounds 1-2, and both teams are competing for playoff positioning and MSI qualification.", "side_yes_case": ["Gen.G maintains a 2-1 match record (5-2 games) in Rounds 1-2, showing strong early season performance", "Limited concrete data on Dplus KIA's recent form against Gen.G specifically", "Gen.G's positioning in upper standings suggests competitive strength relative to other LCK teams"], "side_no_