s opponents. This upcoming BO3 in Rounds 1-2 represents another chance for these teams to establish dominance.", "side_yes_case": ["KT defeated BRO 2-1 in their recent Week 2 matchup with dominant gold control (92.7 GPM in game 2)", "KT showed superior team fighting execution in their wins, securing 9+ towers and 4 dragons in decisive victories", "BRO has inconsistent results across the tournament with multiple 1-2 series losses (vs HLE, BNK FearX, DRX)", "KT secured wins against DN SOOPers 2-1 in Week 1, demonstrating ability to close out series", "BRO's recent form includes losses to DRX in both playoff round (2-3) and Week 3, suggesting plateau in performance"], "side_no_case": ["BRO won game 1 against KT in Week 2 with strong early execution (14 kills, 75.4 GPM)", "BRO showed dominant performances in specific matchups (2-1 over HLE in Week 2 with 9+ kills in victories)", "KT's record against top teams is weak (0-2 losses to T1 and Gen.G), suggesting vulnerability to mid-tier opponents", "BRO has demonstrated ability to win on red side (3 red-side victories including vs DRX and HLE)", "KT's Week 3 performance declined significantly with losses to NS (0-2, then 1-2), indicating recent form regression"], "key_context": ["This is a rematch within same LCK Cup 2026 season; previous meeting (Week 2) occurred recently on patch 16.1", "Both teams competed through playoffs/playin rounds with mixed results before Rounds 1-2", "Match format is BO3, historically favoring more consistent teams with draft flexibility", "KT's recent Week 3 performance was notably poor (0-2 and 2-3 series losses), while BRO also showed inconsistency", "Gold per minute leadership in tournament held by HLE (2399/2324 GPM), with both KT and BRO competing at lower efficiency levels"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-10T20:29:22.553343Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "112121405371280723903285439451690733542760078554089575720598370874470983855591", "data_points": 46, "weighted_avg": 0.18584800559