ure.", "side_yes_case": ["RED Canids achieved 2299 GPM vs paiN Gaming in CBLOL Cup 2026, indicating strong macro play and resource management", "RED Canids defeated FURIA 2-0 in Round 2 and secured 3-1 victory in Round 4, showing consistent BO series performance", "RED Canids won their head-to-head encounter in Week 2 CBLOL Cup 2026 (31 kills, 66.9% gold share)", "RED Canids players Bull and Rabelo ranked in top farming/multikill statistics, indicating strong mechanical execution"], "side_no_case": ["paiN Gaming's Rabelo posted tournament's highest single-game kill count (15 kills vs RED Canids), demonstrating explosive carry potential", "RED Canids went 0-3 against LOUD in Finals, suggesting vulnerability to top-tier competition despite regular season success", "paiN Gaming's Trigger maintains 12.16 CSM (best farm metric), indicating superior economic scaling capability", "RED Canids showed inconsistency with losses to Los Grandes and LOUD in Cup tournament, questioning reliability in BO formats"], "key_context": ["This is a Regular Season match, different context from CBLOL Cup 2026 where recent head-to-head occurred", "Previous head-to-head: RED Canids won Week 2 matchup but sample size limited to single game", "Both teams have recent competitive data from same tournament patch (16.2-16.4)", "RED Canids demonstrated BO3 capability winning 2-0 and 3-1 series, paiN Gaming's BO performance less documented in available data", "Match outcome may depend on which players assume primary carry roles (paiN's Rabelo vs RED's Bull/Duduhh)"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T14:59:22.628514Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "36246543237870711284838322264669580963375692245031309273478350130487267398140", "data_points": 44, "weighted_avg": 0.7689401510244939, "change_1w_pp": 10.999999999999998, "change_24h_pp": 0.5000000000000004, "volatility_24h": 1.4744853823816453, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "71810617806088006284875231988897083670797091