{"run_id": "785885ae-c1e7-4168-b055-3284683a62fd", "timestamp": "2026-04-11T23:04:14.995310+00:00", "legacy": false, "result": {"market": {"id": "1930387", "question": "Valorant: FULL SENSE vs ZETA DIVISION (BO3) - VCT Pacific Group Omega", "resolution_criteria": "This market refers to the Valorant match between FULL SENSE and ZETA DIVISION in the VCT Pacific Group Omega, initially scheduled for April 12 at 4:00AM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"FULL SENSE\" if FULL SENSE win the match against ZETA DIVISION.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"ZETA DIVISION\" if ZETA DIVISION win the match against FULL SENSE.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nIf the match begins but is not completed, and one team wins due to the opponent's forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, this market will resolve to the team who wins. \n\nIf the match ends in a forfeit, disqualification, or walkover (team withdraws before the start and the other wins automatically), this market will resolve to 50-50. \n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://vlr.gg. However, if https://vlr.gg has not published final results within 2 hours after the event\u2019s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.\n\nIn cases where a team\u2019s listed name includes minor discrepancies from the resolution source, this market will resolve based on the underlying real-world match rather than exact name matching. Recognizable abbreviations, alternate or erroneous spellings, sponsor tags, affiliate or academy designations, regional identifiers, and minor formatting differences will be treated as referring to the same team, provided the intended team can be clearly and uniquely identified within the relevant competition. If a listed team name has no reasonable connection to any participating team, or if it matches or could reasonably refer to another team in the same competition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-12T14:00:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-12T08:00:00Z", "yes_price": 0.785, "volume_usd": 37952.858038000006, "category": "valorant", "clob_token_ids": ["115466086283135153680225590708363202510463173973595670729798290818266098688324", "39203748231711232946473552790641668348108827099430120969322736959793883397599"]}, "verdicts": [{"agent_name": "The Rules Lawyer", "probability": 0.76, "confidence_yes": 0.78, "confidence_no": 0.55, "rationale": "FULL SENSE demonstrated dominant Week 1 performance: 2-0 victory over DFM with only 14 combined rounds conceded across two maps, indicating strong current form and coordination. FULL SENSE defeated ZETA 2-0 at VCT Pacific Kickoff (January 22, 2026) \u2014 recent direct precedent favoring FULL SENSE. IGL Crws recently returned to in-game leadership after coaching role; team showed no rust in Week 1, suggesting smooth reintegration and maintained team chemistry. Market price of 78% YES reflects informed trader conviction; 24-hour momentum is +8.0pp for YES side, suggesting confidence is increasing. ZETA's Week 1 performance data is absent from briefing, making competitive assessment one-sided. ZETA lost 0-2 to FULL SENSE at Kickoff but current Stage 1 form is unclear. Both teams are experimenting with double-Duelist compositions and role modifications, but FULL SENSE's successful Neon-Duelist integration in Week 1 provides tangible evidence of execution. Confidence in NO side (55) is lower than confidence in YES (78) due to lack of ZETA performance data in briefing; cannot credibly assess ZETA's current competitive level or recent improvements. Resolution criteria are clear and unambiguous: standard BO3 win condition; only edge case risks are forfeit/disqualification/cancellation (low probability in professional 