amiliarity with new compositions", "FULL SENSE recent history includes VCT Pacific Kickoff win 2-0 over ZETA (January 22, 2026)", "Team appears well-prepared with successful Neon-Duelist experimentation working effectively"], "side_no_case": ["ZETA DIVISION recent head-to-head record shows loss to FULL SENSE 0-2 at Kickoff (January 22, 2026)", "Limited visible Stage 1 performance data for ZETA makes recent form assessment difficult", "FULL SENSE's experimental compositions with multiple new roles could create consistency issues", "Group Omega contains multiple strong teams with competitive depth potentially challenging both squads"], "key_context": ["VCT Pacific Stage 1 Group Omega - S-Tier official league match", "FULL SENSE just returned IGL Crws from coaching role in Week 1", "Recent precedent: FULL SENSE defeated ZETA 2-0 at VCT Pacific Kickoff (January 22, 2026)", "Both teams actively experimenting with double-Duelist and modified role compositions", "Match is part of ongoing group stage - full tournament format implications unclear"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T23:04:03.089054Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "115466086283135153680225590708363202510463173973595670729798290818266098688324", "data_points": 32, "weighted_avg": 0.7140104059829999, "change_1w_pp": 9.000000000000007, "change_24h_pp": 8.000000000000007, "volatility_24h": 1.1868010498925867, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "39203748231711232946473552790641668348108827099430120969322736959793883397599", "data_points": 44, "weighted_avg": 0.28869533149911236, "change_1w_pp": -9.0, "change_24h_pp": -9.5, "volatility_24h": 0.9322619368184987, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": []}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-11T23:04:03.273986Z"}}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-12T14:00:00Z", "winning_side": "YES", "final_yes_price": 1.0, "checked_at": "2026-04-12T17:24:14.740275+00:00", "source": "gamma_api"}, "analysis": null}
