her(1) Breach(2)]  \n   Impact Player: KBG Krst1Ng ACS 245 57/40/16 [Played: Omen(2) Brimstone(1)]\n ALG 2-1 ~~HYG~~  \n   Player of the Match: ALG ugly ACS 211 46/46/17 [Played: Waylay(1) Breach(1) Gekko(1)]  \n   Impact Player: HYG Firstlove ACS 261 57/42/12 [Played: Neon(3)]\n\nposted 1 week ago [...] Former Record: VCT24: CN Kickoff Play-Ins TE 2-1 TEC TE FengF 76/49/24\n\nposted 4 days ago\n\n[China National Tournament [2026: Split Alpha]](/post/6454259/china-national-tournament-2026-split-alpha) in Valorant Discussion\n\n2026 China National Tournament Split Alpha: Pro Division Group Stage Week 2 Day 1 Results:\n\n# April.6th", "With how quickly Stage 1 is going for China, with more matches continuing on Tuesday of week two, each team has already played two matches.", "The two groups for the start of Stage 1 are divided like so: Group Alpha consists of TYLOO, BLG, FPX, JDG, AG, and TEC, while Group Omega includes EDG, XLG, Trace, DRG, Wolves, and Nova.", "The two strongest teams in the first week of Stage 1 both come from Group Omega: EDG and XLG.", "After making another active roster move,   Jieni7   and EDG stomped over both Nova and Wolves.", "XLG also made waves after sweeping Ascension rivals DRG and defeating a retooled Trace team."], "news_summary": "JD Gaming and TEC Esports are scheduled to face off in a VCT China Group Alpha BO3 match. The search results contain fragmented tournament data from VCT China Stage 1 Group Stage matches in March-April 2026, showing various team records but limited specific information about JD Gaming vs TEC Esports head-to-head. All Gamers defeated TEC 2-1 on March 31, 2026, indicating TEC's presence in the competition. The results suggest both teams are competing in the same group stage format.", "side_yes_case": ["All Gamers beat TEC 2-1 recently (March 31), suggesting TEC may be vulnerable to group competitors", "Limited concrete evidence of JD Gaming's recent performance in search results, making outcome uncertain", "TEC's record against established teams appears mixed based on available data"], "side_no_case": ["TEC Esports qualified for VCT China Stage 1 Group Stage, indicating competitive roster strength", "TEC defeated multiple opponents to reach group play including wins during Kickoff tournament", "Insufficient data on JD Gaming's recent form and roster strength in the search results"], "key_context": ["Match is VCT China Stage 1 Group Alpha - official Valorant Champions Tour stage competition", "BO3 format provides multiple maps for teams to showcase adaptability", "All Gamers vs TEC result (2-1 on March 31) shows TEC is competitive but not dominant", "Search results lack direct JD Gaming vs TEC head-to-head history or recent JD Gaming form data", "Tournament appears to be ongoing in April 2026 based on match dates in results"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T23:09:25.436684Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "104539274890305423427045495239693166855636441886163504918890471079891557644856", "data_points": 28, "weighted_avg": 0.575541090998053, "change_1w_pp": 7.499999999999996, "change_24h_pp": -5.500000000000005, "volatility_24h": 5.599376927660967, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-11T07:00:50Z", "delta_pp": 9.499999999999996}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T08:00:48Z", "delta_pp": -7.499999999999996}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T17:00:58Z", "delta_pp": 9.999999999999998}]}, "no": {"token_id": "3700601179190665942678343900146794725507866232780749697772668865313681117914", "data_points": 16, "weighted_avg": 0.40900094549989396, "change_1w_pp": 7.500000000000001, "change_24h_pp": 4.999999999999999, "volatility_24h": 5.286775955154521, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-10T23:00:16Z", "delta_pp": 9.999999999999998}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T08:00:56Z", "delta_pp": 7.500000000000001}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T22:00:05Z", "delta_pp": -7.000000000000001}]}, "fetched_at": "2026-04-11T23:09:25.684070Z"}}}, "resolution": {"res