entially determining advancement scenarios for both teams. Limited detailed current season performance data is available for Wolves Esports in the search results, making direct comparative analysis challenging.", "side_yes_case": ["XLG defeated WOL 2-0 in January 2026 VCT China Kickoff, demonstrating direct head-to-head advantage", "XLG secured 2-0 victory over DRG in April Stage 1 Group Stage, showing current competitive form", "XLG roster includes experienced international players (Rarga, Kr1stal) with established track records", "XLG qualified for Masters Santiago in early 2026, indicating higher competitive tier experience"], "side_no_case": ["XLG showed vulnerability in Masters Santiago with 0-2 losses to both NRG and G2", "XLG had narrow 2-3 loss to AG in VCT China Kickoff, suggesting inconsistency", "Limited recent performance metrics available for Wolves Esports in current season makes direct assessment difficult", "BO3 format introduces variance; previous head-to-head was single encounter in different tournament context"], "key_context": ["Match is VCT China 2026 Stage 1 Group Omega stage with playoff qualification implications", "XLG previously defeated Wolves 2-0 in January Kickoff event, establishing recent head-to-head history", "BO3 format requires winning 2 maps rather than single snapshot of team strength", "Limited detailed statistics for Wolves Esports in current search results restricts comparative analysis", "Group Stage positioning and other concurrent match results may affect playoff seeding stakes"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T23:14:05.712133Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "61332291298125578850981656708854610055344912887481002731406449781581460788731", "data_points": 15, "weighted_avg": 0.6639075993792857, "change_1w_pp": 24.0, "change_24h_pp": 8.999999999999996, "volatility_24h": 3.30529877620768, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-10T02:00:55Z", "delta_pp": 10.999999999999998}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-1