aced each other in the CCT North America Series #4 Playoffs. According to match records from ESL Challenger League Season 51, Team Aether defeated LAG Gaming 2-1 in a Best of 3 series on March 25, 2026. The match included maps Anubis (Aether 13-6), Inferno (Aether 13-8), and Mirage (where LAG forfeited). This was part of the lower bracket competition in the North American playoffs.", "side_yes_case": ["Team Aether won the head-to-head matchup 2-1 against LAG Gaming", "Aether secured convincing map victories on Anubis (13-6) and Inferno (13-8)", "Aether advanced further in the playoff bracket while LAG was eliminated", "LAG forfeited Map 3 (Mirage), indicating potential roster or technical issues"], "side_no_case": ["LAG Gaming lost the series 1-2 to Team Aether", "LAG failed to secure victories on any maps in the series", "LAG forfeited the deciding third map rather than compete", "LAG ranked #141 in Valve Global Ranking indicates mid-tier competitive level"], "key_context": ["Match occurred on March 25, 2026 in CCT NA Series #4 Playoffs lower bracket", "Best of 3 format with maps: Anubis, Inferno, Mirage (forfeited)", "This was an elimination match in the playoff bracket structure", "LAG roster included: djay, Cryptic, consti, kmrn, Sandman", "Team Aether demonstrated consistent performance across multiple map types"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-11T23:16:44.635321Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "114313602407987129984467784683454168230551336077161564335825387560957178831202", "data_points": 5, "weighted_avg": 0.7152687825482619, "change_1w_pp": 2.0000000000000018, "change_24h_pp": 2.0000000000000018, "volatility_24h": 1.1547005383792526, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "40650973526801370742256186384977310580820930503111562016895774294963343774434", "data_points": 5, "weighted_avg": 0.2847311987891817, "change_1w_pp": -1.9999999999999962, "change_24h_pp": -1.9999999999999962, "volatility_24h": 1.1547005383792477, "direction": "