n recent matches, particularly stonezy and Hassan as key fraggers", "Established roster familiarity and VCL Spain experience across multiple stages and competition cycles", "Successful map veto patterns and agent selection strategies shown in recent playoff performances"], "side_no_case": ["Recent VCL EMEA Stage 1 results mixed (1-2 loss to FKS, 0-2 losses to EP), indicating inconsistency against stronger competition", "Limited data on DNSTY's roster strength, recent form, or head-to-head record prevents full competitive assessment", "Transition from Stage 2 success to Rising Phase 1 represents step up in competition level with potentially stronger opponents", "Double-elimination format means single loss doesn't eliminate team, reducing pressure on this specific match"], "key_context": ["Tournament structure: Double-elimination bracket in Valorant Challengers 2026 Spain Rising Stage 3 Phase 1 (April 5-21, 2026)", "Match format: Best-of-three (BO3) playoff match", "Bar\u00e7a eSports recent trajectory: Strong in VCL Spain Stage 2 playoffs, but struggled in VCL EMEA Stage 1 group play", "No direct head-to-head match history provided in search results between Bar\u00e7a eSports and DNSTY", "Seeding based on Championship Points accumulated across tournament stages"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:19:24.746599Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "62396485817704234267977992569406624105059572929114058540619577379673404871935", "data_points": 28, "weighted_avg": 0.5917095490004994, "change_1w_pp": 20.999999999999996, "change_24h_pp": 17.999999999999993, "volatility_24h": 5.859465277082314, "direction": "RISING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-09T07:00:49Z", "delta_pp": -13.0}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T02:00:58Z", "delta_pp": 10.999999999999998}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T17:19:09Z", "delta_pp": 10.999999999999998}]}, "no": {"token_id": "77238294486178717515557035031598043395418544658523329136884027610249343499525", "data_points": 42, "weighted_avg": 0.40657