 that series, with wins over Disguised and Team Liquid but losses to Team Liquid earlier in Swiss rounds. Cloud9 has demonstrated strong momentum with multiple dominant wins through Swiss and playoff stages.", "side_yes_case": ["Cloud9 swept Sentinels 3-0 most recently in Lock-In playoffs, winning games with decisive gold and objective advantages", "Cloud9 consistently strong across both Swiss and playoff stages, winning multiple series 2-0 and 3-0 against various opponents", "Sentinels showed inconsistency in Lock-In performance with multiple round 1 losses and mixed results despite some wins", "Cloud9 demonstrated superior gold efficiency and objective control across all three recent games vs Sentinels"], "side_no_case": ["Sentinels defeated Team Liquid 2-1 in a close Swiss round series, showing ability to compete in close matchups", "Lock-In tournament meta and regular season meta may differ, limiting predictive value of recent playoff results", "Sentinels had some dominant performances (e.g., 71.4% gold share win vs DSG) indicating capability for high-level play", "Regular season matches often see different draft priorities and team compositions than tournament playoffs"], "key_context": ["Cloud9 swept Sentinels 3-0 in most recent direct matchup (LCS 2026 Lock-In Playoffs Round 2)", "This is a regular season match, potentially with different team preparation and meta than the Lock-In tournament", "Cloud9 has shown consistently stronger performance across all recent stages vs Sentinels's mixed results", "Both teams played in patch 16.2-16.4 during Lock-In; current patch status for regular season unclear", "Head-to-head record in recent competition heavily favors Cloud9 across multiple series"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-12T17:24:04.454362Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "5569710620627195107345645961179386656491317004748480473670916267891896533693", "data_points": 58, "weighted_avg": 0.1973399197867581, "change_1w_pp": 3.0, "change_24h_pp": 5.49999999999