 over the last 2 months.", "The world ranking is based on teams' achievements over the past year (with severe decay in points throughout each month), recent form over the last 2 months and performance at the last 10 LAN events.", "All of that is predicated around a 3-man core each team is required to have in order to retain their past points.", "Online matches and tournaments are included, but with a diminishing factor which means they cannot make a big difference among the top teams, and mainly serve to put new teams on the map."], "news_summary": "CCT South America 2026 Challengers #1 is an online CS2 tournament featuring South American teams competing in a Challenger-tier (C-Tier/Valve Tier 2) event. Crashers is a registered South American team with 783 Valve ranking points and recent competitive experience, including a loss to Keyd Stars at BetBoom Storm Season 2. HereWeGoAgain's specific credentials and recent form are not detailed in the search results. This Best-of-3 playoff match will determine advancement in the regional challengers circuit.", "side_yes_case": ["Crashers has documented Valve ranking points (783), indicating established competitive standing", "Crashers has recent tournament experience against tier-1 South American opposition (Keyd Stars match)", "HereWeGoAgain's roster strength and recent performance data are unavailable in search results"], "side_no_case": ["Crashers recently lost to Keyd Stars 0-2, suggesting potential vulnerabilities", "Limited performance data available for Crashers in 2026 season beyond single match result", "HereWeGoAgain's participation in CCT Challengers #1 indicates they qualified for playoffs"], "key_context": ["Match format: Best-of-3 (BO3) in CCT South America Challengers #1 Playoffs", "Tournament tier: C-Tier/Valve Tier 2 online event for South American teams", "Venue: Online competition", "Recent precedent: Keyd Stars defeated Crashers 2-0 at BetBoom Storm Season 2 (April 7, 2026)"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-