 match in the LCK Challengers League Rounds 1-2. HANJIN BRION currently holds a 42% win rate (5-7 record) with a -99 game differential, while KT Rolster Challengers maintains a 50% win rate (5-5 record) with a -78 game differential. KT Rolster has demonstrated slightly better performance in the standings and recent metrics. Both teams are competing in a competitive mid-tier environment within the LCK CL structure.", "side_yes_case": ["KT Rolster has superior win rate (50% vs 42%) and better standing position in current rankings", "KT Rolster shows less negative game differential (-78 vs -99), indicating better late-game execution", "HANJIN BRION's recent match history shows consistent losses to stronger opponents (T1, NS, KRX)", "KT Rolster completed a Group stage undefeated (2-0) in recent Group Drake competition"], "side_no_case": ["HANJIN BRION achieved a 3-0 sweep victory over GEN.G Global Academy (Gen.G Academy) in Week 3, showing capability against tier-1 academy teams", "Both teams have nearly identical win-loss records (5-7 vs 5-5), indicating competitive parity", "HANJIN BRION's longer average game duration (35:44 vs 33:06) suggests team resilience in extended macro play", "KT Rolster's narrow 5-5 record shows inconsistency despite marginally better metrics"], "key_context": ["This is a Rounds 1-2 match in the LCK Challengers League 2026 season, indicating early-stage competition", "HANJIN BRION showed dramatic improvement in Week 3 with 3-0 victory, suggesting upward form trajectory", "No direct head-to-head record between these teams visible in provided data", "Both teams occupy mid-table positions (5th and 7th place) with similar competitive levels", "KT Rolster placed 1st in Group Drake Week 3 with undefeated record (2-0), indicating recent momentum"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T00:31:46.516503Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "68612196990011309622122725747396408469095336650429550145738304188155159743195", "data_points": 13, "weighted_avg": 0