ompetition such that the intended team cannot be unambiguously determined, this market will resolve 50-50.", "end_date": "2026-04-13T21:30:00Z", "event_start_time": "2026-04-13T15:30:00Z", "yes_price": 0.595, "volume_usd": 5991.735966000003, "category": "counter-strike", "clob_token_ids": ["21560932918180481023981289999848884093755505766429467313140166032332363375345", "53151276850815591559581217112338024846549857811247038992742965773324260360455"]}, "key_facts": ["Contenders Stage: 16 Team Swiss System Format.", "All matches are Bo3; Top 8 teams proceed to the Main Stage.", "Click here for a detailed explanation of the", "Exort Series #25 is an online European CS2 tournament organized by Exort.", "This C-Tier tournament takes place from Apr 06 to 26 2026 featuring 28 teams", "| Date | Matches |  |\n --- \n| European Pro League Series 6 | | |\n --- \n| 11/04/2026 | MetizportMetizport  2:0  Basement BobsBasement Bobs | Stats |\n|\n| CCT Season 3 Europe Series 20 - 20-22nd | | |\n --- \n| 04/04/2026 | MetizportMetizport  1:2  BebopBebop | Stats |\n| 02/04/2026 | MetizportMetizport  0:2  QWENTRYQWENTRY | Stats |\n| 01/04/2026 | MetizportMetizport  2:0  ENCE AcademyENCE Academy | Stats |\n| 29/03/2026 | MetizportMetizport  1:2  RUSTECRUSTECRUSTEC | Stats |\n|\n| ROG JOURNEY Spring 2026 - 5-8th | | |\n --- \n| 27/03/2026 | MetizportMetizport  0:2  EYEBALLERSEYEBALLERSEYEBALLERS | Stats |\n| 23/03/2026 | MetizportMetizport  2:0  UNiTYUNiTY | Stats |\n| 23/03/2026 | MetizportMetizport  0:2  GamerLegionGamerLegion | Stats |\n| 23/03/2026 | MetizportMetizport  2:1  UNiTYUNiTY | Stats | [...] Legacy\nBruno 'latto' Rebelatto\n\n# KAST\n\n# RANKING\n\nVitality\nVitality\nNatus Vincere\nFURIA\nFalcons\nPARIVISION\n\n# EVENTS\n\nPGL Bucharest 2026\nPGL Bucharest 2026\nIEM Rio 2026\nIEM Rio 2026\nBLAST Rivals 2026 Season 1\nPGL Astana 2026\nIEM Atlanta 2026\nIEM Atlanta 2026\n\n# FPL RANKING\n\nMustafa 'Shooter' Kamal\nrecar\nBelal 'AbbyDog' Embaby\nWyatt 'Weeza' Sahrmann\nWyatt 'snav' Phillippi\n\n# GALLERIES\n\n# RECENT ACTIVITY\n\n# MINIGAME\n\n# TOP 30 TRANSFERS\n\nAleksandr 'zorte' Zagodyrenko\nTDK\nBetBoom\nArtem 'ArtFr0st' Kharitonov\nBetBoom\nBetBoom\nLucas 'nqz' Soares\npaiN\npaiN\npaiN\npaiN\nKacper 'xKacpersky' Gabara\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nNinjas in Pyjamas\nJeorge 'Jeorge'  Endicott\nNRG\nVoca\nVoca\nThumbnail for stream\nRussia\n\nRussia\n\nSweden\n\nRussia\n\nRussia\n\nFrance\n\nFrance\n\nUkraine\n\nRussia [...] HLTV.org\nHLTV.org\nHLTV.org\n\nHLTV.org\n\nMetizport\nImage of Counter-Strike player isak\n\n# isak\n\nSweden\nMetizport\n\n## isak statistics(Past 3 months \u2022 96 maps)\n\n1.02\n\n\")\n\n57/100\n\n25/100\n\n50/100\n\n37/100\n\n66/100\n\n0/100\n\n51/100\n\n## Upcoming & recent matches\n\nex-RUBY\nBasement Bobs\nBebop\nQWENTRY\nENCE Academy\nRUSTEC\nRUSTEC\n\n## isak's inventory\n\n## isak's skins Match verified skins\n\n## isak's loadout\n\n### Pistols\n\n## USP-S Collection(10)\n\n## P250 Collection(4)\n\n## Desert Eagle Collection(4)\n\n### Mid-Tier\n\n### Rifles\n\n## AWP Collection(2)\n\n## M4A1-S Collection(4)\n\n### Pistols\n\n## Glock-18 Collection(6)\n\n## P250 Collection(4)\n\n## Desert Eagle Collection(4)\n\n### Mid-Tier\n\n### Rifles\n\n## AWP Collection(2)\n\n## AK-47 Collection(6)\n\n## Galil Ar Collection(3)\n\n## Pictures of isak\n\n## Team stats for isak", "Carlos 'venomzera' Eduardo \u00b7 venomzera \u00b7 Most kills.", "19 ; Filip 'Graviti' Brankovic \u00b7 Graviti \u00b7 Most damage.", "82.2 ; Bryan 'Maka' Canda \u00b7 Maka \u00b7 Most assists.", "### Detailed Results\n\n[edit]\n\n#### Round 1\n\n[edit]\n\nRound 1 Matches\n\nShow\n\nHide\n\nApril 6, 2026\n\nNIC\n\n2\n\n0\n\nZ7\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 11:30 CEST\n\nNIC\")\n\n2:0(Bo3)\n\nZ7\")\n\n13\n\n76\n\nOverpass\n\n9\n\n54\n\n13\n\n58\n\nMirage\n\n11\n\n74\n\n~~Inferno~~\n\nWingman\n\n2\n\n0\n\nWave\n\nApril 6, 2026 - 14:30 CEST\n\nWingman\")\n\n2:0(Bo3)\n\nWave\")\n\n13\n\n103\n\nNuke\n\n8\n\n26\n\n13\n\n67\n\nAn