 [...] 2025\n\n2026\n\n2027\n\nBRUTE\n\nEnterprise\n\nSampiSampi\n\nfnatic\n\nG2\n\n## Timeline of MATYS's teams\n\nCurrent ranking\n\n#12\n\nPeak\n\n#5\n\nTime at peak\n\n2 weeks\n\n## Upcoming matches for MATYS\n\n| Date | Matches |\n --- |\n| IEM Rio 2026 |\n| 13/04/2026 | G2G2  -:-  Gentle MatesGentle Mates | Match |\n| BLAST Rivals 2026 Season 1 |\n| 29/04/2026 | G2G2  -:-  AstralisAstralis | Match |\n\n## Latest results for MATYS", "1 team list revealed11/4 Short: Galaxy Battle Phase 1 set to start26/3 ZywOo more expensive than donk in BLAST Lisbon playoffs Fantasy24/3 NIP and WildLotus complete PGL Astana EU CQ team list13/3 Short: First PGL Astana open qualifiers tomorrow12/3 ropz among the most picked as EPL Playoffs fantasy kicks off17/2 Short: EYEBALLERS invited to CCT 19 CQ16/2 CCT Season 2 Europe Series 19 teams announced14/2 Tricked return with valde and former Gaimin Gladiators core4/2 CCT S2 Europe Series 18 invites revealed30/1 HEROIC among invites for CCT Europe Series 1728/1 IEM Katowice Fantasy kicks off with Play-in game27/1 Meta Monday: How Train's early adopters are shaping the meta21/1 Short: Monte, ECSTATIC withdraw from YaLLa Compass Winter13/1 kraghen joins 9INE after refrezh benching11/1 Top 20 [...] |  |\n| CCT Season 3 Europe Series 18 - 9-16th |\n| 17/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 435: ECSTATIC 0:2 Image 436: UrsaUrsa | Match |\n|  |\n| POWER Ligaen Season 31 - 3rd |\n| 15/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 437: ECSTATIC 2:0 Image 438: AaBAaB | Match |\n| 15/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 439: ECSTATIC 1:2 Image 440: TrickedTricked | Match |\n| 14/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 441: ECSTATIC 2:1 Image 442: MASONICMASONIC | Match |\n| 14/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 443: ECSTATIC 13:6 Image 444: PrestigePrestige | Match |\n|  |\n| A1 Gaming League Season 11 - 3-4th |\n| 07/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 445: ECSTATIC 0:2 Image 446: NemigaNemiga | Match |\n|  |\n| NODWIN Clutch Series 5 - 2nd |\n| 05/03/2026 | ECSTATICImage 447: ECSTATIC 1:2 Image 448: BIGImage 449: BIGBIG | Matc