nt gold control and kill advantage (28-17 kills, 92.7% vs 82.2% gold)", "RED Canids demonstrated consistent wins against multiple opponents including FUR, FX, paiN Gaming, and VKS in recent Cup competition", "RED Canids showed strong blue side performance with multiple wins securing objectives and maintaining resource advantages", "Leviatan's only recent notable result was the Week 1 victory but lacks visible recent match data suggesting potential stagnation"], "side_no_case": ["RED Canids suffered decisive losses to LOUD in CBLOL Cup Round 4 (1-3 series loss with three consecutive game defeats)", "RED Canids lost to Los Grandes and dropped games to FURIA in recent competition, showing inconsistency against top-tier opponents", "RED Canids' gold efficiency metrics declined significantly in losses, indicating macro and teamfighting vulnerabilities", "Limited recent match data for Leviatan makes direct comparative analysis difficult, but their previous victory suggests competitive capability"], "key_context": ["This is a CBLOL Regular Season match (distinct from the CBLOL Cup 2026 data shown)", "RED Canids' recent data is primarily from CBLOL Cup 2026; tournament context and ruleset may differ for Regular Season", "Leviatan beat RED Canids 1-0 in Week 1 CBLOL Cup at 44:09 game length with strong teamfighting", "RED Canids showed volatile performance in Cup competition with wins against mid-tier teams but losses to LOUD and occasional upsets", "BO3 format requires consistency across multiple games; single-game data points have limited predictive value"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T18:33:23.714973Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "48053489525688181672093143954659158093639066984719147910581679075080929579973", "data_points": 39, "weighted_avg": 0.17396785910861304, "change_1w_pp": -13.5, "change_24h_pp": -2.0000000000000004, "volatility_24h": 0.0, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-09T00:00:37Z", "delta_pp": -9.000000000000002}, {"t