ayoffs | PGL Wallachia S7 - Playoffs |  | 0 : 2 | BB | Details |\n\nPREMIER SERIES - Playoffs\nPREMIER SERIES - Playoffs [...] Serbia\nBrazil\n\n### Match History\n\n| Date | Tier |  | Tournament | Opponent | Score | | | vs.", "Opponent |  |\n ---  ---  ---  ---  --- |\n| These teams have not played any matches against each other yet."], "news_summary": "BTC Gaming and Estar Backs (EB) are set to compete in a BO3 match at the DreamLeague S29 South America Closed Qualifier Playoffs. Recent match data shows BTC Gaming defeated Hokori 2-0 in the same tournament on April 12, 2026, while Estar Backs lost to BarrancoBar 1-2 on the same date. Both teams are competing in the South American Dota 2 qualifier circuit with significant tournament experience. The match represents a playoff-stage contest where qualification advancement may be at stake.", "side_yes_case": ["BTC Gaming recently won 2-0 vs Hokori in DreamLeague S29 SA CQ (April 12, 2026)", "Estar Backs lost their most recent DreamLeague S29 match 1-2 vs BarrancoBar (April 12, 2026)", "BTC Gaming showed better recent performance trajectory in the same tournament", "EB has mixed recent results in CCT S2 SA Series 3 playoffs with two 1-2 losses (March 5-6)"], "side_no_case": ["Estar Backs defeated BarrancoBar 2-1 in their DreamLeague S29 SA CQ opener (April 12, 2026)", "BTC Gaming's loss to VP in RES Unchained 4 EU OQ2 (April 1, 2026) suggests vulnerability against stronger opponents", "BTC Gaming lost twice in CCT S2 SA Series 3 playoffs with 1-2 results (March 5-6)", "Limited recent head-to-head data between these specific teams"], "key_context": ["This is a playoff-stage match in DreamLeague S29 SA Closed Qualifier (likely affects stakes and team preparation)", "Both teams compete in the South American region with access to similar talent pool and competitive level", "Recent matches (April 8-12, 2026) show both teams in active tournament play", "BO3 format reduces variance compared to single-game matches", "Sample si