QoR in VCL NA: Stage 2 that will take place on April 13, 2026 - 19:00 EDT."], "news_summary": "Alliance Guardians will face QoR in a VCL NA Stage 2 Group Stage BO3 match scheduled for April 13, 2026. The match is part of the VALORANT Challengers 2026 North America Stage 2 Swiss system format, where teams compete in a 16-team tournament with BO3 matches. QoR has shown competitive performance with players like Derrek and Notexxd appearing in statistical rankings. Both teams are competing in the same regional circuit with advancement based on match wins.", "side_yes_case": ["Match is confirmed scheduled for April 13, 2026 suggesting both teams have qualified for this round", "QoR appears to have participated in prior Stage 2 matches (vs SRB on April 6), indicating active roster and experience in the tournament"], "side_no_case": ["Limited direct head-to-head or recent form data available for Alliance Guardians in search results", "Insufficient comparative player statistics or team performance metrics provided for either team in this specific match"], "key_context": ["Swiss Stage format runs March 23 - April 22, 2026 with all matches as BO3", "Teams need 4 wins to advance to Playoffs", "Match scheduled for April 13, 2026 at 19:00 EDT", "VCL NA Stage 2 is part of VALORANT Challengers 2026 North America structure", "No recent head-to-head record or direct competitive history provided in available data"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-13T22:57:12.367835Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "69600105900936699361990805146620912845395253640672513024105039671451895643462", "data_points": 33, "weighted_avg": 0.3259555702334005, "change_1w_pp": -18.0, "change_24h_pp": 0.0, "volatility_24h": 0.4082482904638634, "direction": "FALLING", "sharp_moves": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-11T11:00:56Z", "delta_pp": -11.5}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T01:00:56Z", "delta_pp": 6.499999999999995}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-12T11:00:58Z", "delta_pp": -5.500000000000005}]}, "no": {"token_id": "10812783073