 Day one results showed all eight opening matches went to the higher seeds, suggesting favorites performed as expected at the tournament. Both teams are competing at a major international LAN event in Brazil with significant prize pool implications.", "side_yes_case": ["Navi favored in betting markets with 1.62 odds indicating oddsmakers' confidence", "Higher seed status historically advantageous - day one saw all favorites prevail", "Navi has roster stability with experienced core familiar with high-pressure LAN events", "FURIA facing yellow jersey controversy and potential internal distraction"], "side_no_case": ["FURIA competing in home country (Brazil) with potential crowd support advantage", "FURIA odds of 2.25 indicate legitimate underdog viability per market assessment", "Navi org perception concerns noted in community commentary may affect team cohesion", "No specific recent form data provided showing either team's recent performance trajectory"], "key_context": ["Tournament format: IEM Rio 2026 Group B stage, Best-of-3 match", "Venue: Brazil - home country for FURIA, away for Navi", "Tournament structure: Day one showed strong favorite performance (8/8 matches favored higher seeds)", "Market odds reflect Navi as betting favorite but FURIA as viable challenger", "Match timing and stakes part of major international LAN with significant prize implications"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-14T16:53:02.702665Z", "price_history": {"yes": {"token_id": "54155307984726027249634934237209984271273592207616136135832749827731033286298", "data_points": 15, "weighted_avg": 0.5600159093446231, "change_1w_pp": -0.9999999999999898, "change_24h_pp": -0.9999999999999898, "volatility_24h": 0.2672612419124217, "direction": "STABLE", "sharp_moves": []}, "no": {"token_id": "52636505187683393235915085551350315757729095735230082792308938034700560857577", "data_points": 11, "weighted_avg": 0.4407912555018829, "change_1w_pp": 1.0000000000000009, "change_24h_pp": 1.0000000000000009, "volat